{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GET-BITS function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309562","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-BITS-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GET-BITS-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GET-BITS-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GET-BITS function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Interprets one or more consecutive bits in\nan integer variable or field as an ABL integer value and returns\nthat value.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BITS-function__syntax_GC18MI2693410\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d500935e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GET-BITS-function__idGDL2HJ2671048\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GET-BITS( <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">numbits</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An ABL integer variable.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A variable or expression that returns an integer. This parameter designates\nthe position of the lowest-order bit of the bits that are to be interpreted\nas an integer. Bits are numbered from 1 through the length of an\ninteger; with 1 being the low-order bit. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is\ngreater than the length of an integer, the AVM returns the Unknown value (<code class=\"ph codeph\">?</code>).\nIf <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> is less than 1, the AVM generates\na run-time error.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">numbits</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The number of bits to examine when generating the return value.\nIf <var class=\"keyword varname\">position</var> plus <var class=\"keyword varname\">numbits</var> is greater\nthan the length of an integer plus 1, the AVM generates a run-time error.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BITS-function__note_GC18MJ2693425\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d500935e185\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This function\ncan return a value greater than 32 bits if <var class=\"keyword varname\">source</var> is\nan INT64.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GET-BITS-function__see-also_GC18MK2693431\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d500935e197\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUT-BITS-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUT-BITS-statement.html#PUT-BITS-statement\">PUT-BITS statement</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-statement.html\">GET statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-BYTE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BYTE-function.html\">GET-BYTE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309562","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GET-BITS function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-BITS-function.html","type":"Manual"}